# Bloater (the Dead): a swollen corpse, a belly wider than it is tall on stubby legs, small arms, a sunken head.
# Rot-green eyes and glowing rot boils on the belly (its light cue). Slow and very hard to put down.
name bloater
grid 5
size 22 22 36
slot body Flesh
slot rag InkBrown
slot eye Rot
box 8 6 0 11 10 10 rag
box 8 12 0 11 16 10 rag
ellipsoid 11 11 18 9 8.5 9 body
paint box 0 0 12 22 22 15 rag
sphere 19 8 20 1.5 eye
sphere 18 14 15 1.5 eye
sphere 16 5 24 1.2 eye
sphere 5 16 22 1.3 eye
sphere 4 7 17 1.2 eye
ellipsoid 12 11 25 4 9 2.5 body
beam 12 1 25 16 1 13 1.5 body
beam 12 21 25 16 21 13 1.5 body
box 13 8 26 18 14 31 body
box 17 9 28 18 10 30 eye
box 17 12 28 18 13 30 eye
noise 0.12 7 rag
pivot 11 11 0
# R20 animation segments (Brute gait roles): stubby legs from the hip, arms from the shoulders, the head from the neck.
part LegL 0 0 0 22 11 10 9.5 8 10
part LegR 0 11 0 22 22 10 9.5 14 10
part ArmL 10 0 12 22 3 28 12 1 25
part ArmR 10 19 12 22 22 28 12 21 25
part Head 12 7 28 22 15 36 15 11 28
